<MainLayout title="About us" description="Learn about Vijayman Unnatdhara Welfare Foundation, its service philosophy and leadership." eyebrow="About the foundation"><section class="section shell intro-grid"><div><SectionHeading eyebrow="Our story" title="Built around a simple idea: service should feel close to home." /></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Vijayman Unnatdhara Welfare Foundation is a Section 8 non-profit foundation based in Lalitpur, Uttar Pradesh.</p><p>The foundation is establishing its public identity with a commitment to responsible social welfare, community participation and inclusive development. Its story is still being documented; this website will grow with approved activities, reports and experiences rather than filling gaps with assumptions.</p><h2>Our values</h2><ul><li>Humanity and compassion</li><li>Integrity and accountability</li><li>Equality and participation</li><li>Transparency in what we publish</li></ul></div></section><section class="section section-tint"><div class="shell"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Our identity" title="The people behind the foundation" text="The three directors named below are taken from the foundation’s supplied business card. Approved biographies will be added when provided." /><div class="profile-grid"><div class="profile-card"><span class="eyebrow">Director</span><h3>Vijay Verma</h3><p>Leadership profile pending approval.</p></div><div class="profile-card"><span class="eyebrow">Director</span><h3>Durgesh</h3><p>Leadership profile pending approval.</p></div><div class="profile-card"><span class="eyebrow">Director</span><h3>Omkar Rathore</h3><p>Leadership profile pending approval.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section shell trust-grid"><div><SectionHeading eyebrow="A note on verification" title="Clear about what we know." /><p class="prose">Some registration details appear on supplied materials, while other variants appear in third-party directories. We will update this page when official records and authorized confirmation resolve the differences.</p></div><TrustNote>{organization.identity.cin.value} and {organization.identity.section8License.value} are supplied on the business card and are awaiting independent confirmation.</TrustNote></section></MainLayout>
